<title>UK: Preliminary ACPC 95/6 exports seen at 47 mln bags.</title>
<headline>Preliminary ACPC 95/6 exports seen at 47 mln bags.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>An official of the Association of Coffee Producing Countries (ACPC) said on Monday preliminary figures showed ACPC exports in the 1995/96 period reached 47 million 60-kilo bags against a target of 45.8 million.</p>
</text>
